      "source": "For customization of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> used by Quartz, use of\n<a href=\"QuartzDataSource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.quartz.autoconfigure\"><code>@QuartzDataSource</code></a> is preferred. It will ensure consistent\ncustomization of both the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/quartz/SchedulerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\"><code>SchedulerFactoryBean</code></a> and the\n<a href=\"QuartzDataSourceScriptDatabaseInitializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.quartz.autoconfigure\"><code>QuartzDataSourceScriptDatabaseInitializer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "若要自定义 Quartz 使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>，建议使用 <a href=\"QuartzDataSource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.quartz.autoconfigure\"><code>@QuartzDataSource</code></a>。这将确保对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/scheduling/quartz/SchedulerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\"><code>SchedulerFactoryBean</code></a> 和 <a href=\"QuartzDataSourceScriptDatabaseInitializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.quartz.autoconfigure\"><code>QuartzDataSourceScriptDatabaseInitializer</code></a> 进行一致的自定义。",
      "count": 2
